<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<meta charset="UTF-8">
		<title>Casablanca Business Forum</title>
		<style>:root
		{
			--navy: #10232d;
			--navy-soft: #16303d;
			--teal-1: #2c6e6a;
			--teal-2: #4fa89c;
			--teal-3: #7fd6c2;
			--teal-4: #bff0e2;
			--mint: #e7f5f1;
			--red: #c94a34;
			--white: #ffffff;
			--ink: #1c2b30;
		}
		* {
			box-sizing: border-box;
		}
		body {
			margin: 0;
			font-family: 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif;
			background: var(--white);
			color: var(--ink);
		}
		h1,
		h2,
		h3 {
			font-family: 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif;
			letter-spacing: 0.5px;
			margin: 0;
		}
		a {
			color: inherit;
		}
		.btn-register {
			display: inline-block;
			background: var(--teal-3);
			color: var(--navy);
			font-weight: 700;
			font-size: 13px;
			letter-spacing: 1px;
			padding: 10px 26px;
			border: none;
			border-radius: 20px;
			cursor: pointer;
			text-transform: uppercase;
		}
		.btn-register:hover {
			background: var(--teal-4);
		}

		/* ============ HEADER SECTION ============ */
		.header-section {
			position: relative;
			background: var(--navy);
			color: var(--white);
			padding: 28px 6% 60px;
			overflow: hidden;
		}
		.header-section .nav-bar {
			display: flex;
			justify-content: space-between;
			align-items: center;
			position: relative;
			z-index: 2;
		}
		.header-section .logo-slot img {
			height: 44px;
			display: block;
		}
		.header-section .nav-links {
			display: flex;
			gap: 22px;
			background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
			padding: 10px 18px;
			border-radius: 24px;
			font-size: 13px;
		}
		.header-section .hero-content {
			position: relative;
			z-index: 2;
			margin-top: 60px;
			max-width: 560px;
		}
		.header-section .hero-content h1 {
			font-size: 44px;
			line-height: 1.15;
		}
		.header-section .hero-content h1 span {
			color: var(--teal-3);
		}
		.header-section .edition-row {
			display: flex;
			align-items: center;
			gap: 12px;
			margin: 14px 0;
			font-size: 13px;
		}
		.header-section .edition-row .date-pill {
			background: var(--teal-3);
			color: var(--navy);
			font-weight: 700;
			padding: 5px 14px;
			border-radius: 14px;
		}
		.header-section .hero-sub {
			font-size: 20px;
			font-weight: 600;
			margin-bottom: 22px;
		}
		.header-section .support-row {
			display: flex;
			align-items: center;
			gap: 10px;
			font-size: 12px;
			opacity: .85;
			margin-bottom: 24px;
		}
		.header-section .support-row .support-logo-slot img {
			height: 26px;
		}
		/* decorative fan graphic — replace via .header-section .fan-graphic svg if desired */
		.fan-graphic {
			position: absolute;
			top: -40px;
			right: -40px;
			z-index: 1;
			opacity: .9;
		}

		/* ============ INTRO / ABOUT SECTION (section 2) ============ */
		.intro-section {
			background: var(--white);
			padding: 70px 8%;
		}
		.intro-section .intro-title {
			font-size: 30px;
			color: var(--navy);
			margin-bottom: 26px;
		}
		.intro-section .intro-text {
			max-width: 900px;
			font-size: 14.5px;
			line-height: 1.7;
			color: #3a4a4f;
		}
		.intro-section .intro-text p {
			margin: 0 0 16px;
		}
		.intro-section .intro-text a {
			color: var(--red);
			text-decoration: underline;
			font-weight: 600;
		}
		.intro-section .featured-speaker {
			display: flex;
			gap: 24px;
			align-items: center;
			margin-top: 40px;
			padding-top: 34px;
			border-top: 1px solid #e6e6e6;
		}
		.intro-section .featured-speaker .img-slot {
			width: 110px;
			height: 110px;
			border-radius: 8px;
			overflow: hidden;
			flex-shrink: 0;
			background: #dcecec;
		}
		.intro-section .featured-speaker .img-slot img {
			width: 100%;
			height: 100%;
			object-fit: cover;
			display: block;
		}
		.intro-section .featured-speaker .fs-name {
			font-size: 20px;
			color: var(--navy);
			font-weight: 700;
		}
		.intro-section .featured-speaker .fs-badge {
			display: inline-block;
			background: var(--red);
			color: #fff;
			font-size: 11px;
			font-weight: 700;
			padding: 3px 10px;
			border-radius: 3px;
			margin: 8px 0;
		}
		.intro-section .featured-speaker .fs-bio {
			font-size: 13px;
			color: #4a4a4a;
			max-width: 640px;
			line-height: 1.6;
		}

		/* ============ SPEAKERS SECTION (section 3) ============ */
		.speakers-section {
			background: var(--navy);
			color: var(--white);
			padding: 70px 8% 90px;
		}
		.speakers-section .speakers-title {
			font-size: 28px;
			margin-bottom: 36px;
		}
		.speakers-section .speakers-grid {
			display: grid;
			grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
			gap: 36px 24px;
		}
		.speaker-card {
			position: relative;
			text-align: center;
			cursor: pointer;
		}
		.speaker-card.hidden-speaker {
			display: none;
		}
		.speaker-card .avatar-ring {
			width: 160px;
			height: 160px;
			margin: 0 auto 35px;
			border-radius: 50%;
			background: conic-gradient(#5fd9a8 0turn,#1c9c78 0.5turn,#5fd9a8 1turn);
			padding: 6px;
		}
		.speaker-card .avatar-ring .avatar-slot {
			width: 100%;
			height: 100%;
			border-radius: 50%;
			overflow: hidden;
			background: #2a3f47;
			display: flex;
			align-items: center;
			justify-content: center;
		}
		.speaker-card .avatar-ring .avatar-slot img {
			width: 100%;
			height: 100%;
			object-fit: cover;
			display: block;
		}
		.speaker-card .sp-name {
			font-weight: 700;
			font-size: 14px;
		}
		.speaker-card .sp-role {
			font-size: 11px;
			opacity: .75;
			line-height: 1.4;
			margin-top: 2px;
		}

		/* hover tooltip bio card */
		.speaker-card .sp-tooltip {
			position: absolute;
			bottom: calc(100% + 12px);
			left: 50%;
			transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(6px);
			width: 260px;
			background: var(--white);
			color: var(--ink);
			font-size: 12px;
			line-height: 1.6;
			padding: 16px;
			border-radius: 6px;
			box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35);
			opacity: 0;
			visibility: hidden;
			transition: opacity 0.18s ease, transform 0.18s ease;
			z-index: 5;
			text-align: left;
		}
		.speaker-card:hover .sp-tooltip {
			opacity: 1;
			visibility: visible;
			transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(0);
		}
		.speakers-section .view-all-wrap {
			text-align: right;
			margin-top: 30px;
		}
		.speakers-section .view-all-btn {
			background: none;
			border: none;
			color: var(--teal-3);
			font-size: 13px;
			font-weight: 600;
			cursor: pointer;
			text-decoration: underline;
		}

		/* ============ HIGHLIGHTS SECTION (section 4) ============ */
		.highlights-section {
			background: var(--mint);
			padding: 70px 8% 90px;
			text-align: center;
		}
		.highlights-section .highlights-title {
			font-size: 28px;
			color: var(--navy);
			margin-bottom: 40px;
		}
		.highlights-section .highlight-row {
			display: flex;
			gap: 26px;
			text-align: left;
			max-width: 980px;
			margin: 0 auto 30px;
			align-items: flex-start;
		}
		.sp-name {
			position: relative;
			display: block;
			font-size: 28px;
			font-weight: 600;
			color: #fff;
			text-align: center;

		}

		.sp-name::after {
			content: "";
			display: block;
			width: 100%;
			max-width: 40%; /* adjust as needed */
			height: 2px;
			background: #3ec7c3;
			margin: 5px auto 0;
		}
		.highlights-section .tag {
			flex-shrink: 0;
			width: 130px;
			text-align: center;
			border: 1px solid var(--navy);
			border-radius: 16px;
			padding: 6px 10px;
			font-size: 12px;
			font-weight: 700;
			color: var(--navy);
		}
		.highlights-section .highlight-body h3 {
			font-size: 14px;
			color: var(--red);
			margin-bottom: 6px;
		}
		.highlights-section .highlight-body p {
			font-size: 13px;
			line-height: 1.6;
			color: #3a4a4f;
			margin: 0;
		}

		/* ============ REGISTER SECTION (section 5) ============ */
		.register-section {
			position: relative;
			padding: 80px 8% 40px;
			color: var(--white);
			text-align: center;
			background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(16,35,45,.55), rgba(16,35,45,.9)), var(--bg-slot, linear-gradient(160deg, #1c3742, #0c1a20));
			background-size: cover;
			background-position: center;
		}
		/* to use a real photo: set --bg-slot via inline style or replace the linear-gradient above with url('your-image.jpg') */
		.register-section .register-title {
			font-size: 26px;
			margin-bottom: 30px;
		}
		.register-section form {
			display: flex;
			flex-direction: column;
			gap: 12px;
			max-width: 380px;
			margin: 0 auto 26px;
		}
		.register-section input {
			padding: 12px 16px;
			border-radius: 6px;
			border: none;
			font-size: 13px;
			background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
			color: #fff;
		}
		#header {
			padding: 0;
		}
		#header img {
			width: 100%;
			height: 100%;
		}

		#header .hero-content {
			margin: 0;
			max-width: initial;
			position: relative;
		}

		.kk_kk .btn-register {
			margin: auto;
			text-align: center;
			width: auto;
			display: flex;
			position: relative;
			top: -17px;
			z-index: 99;
		}
		.register-section input::placeholder {
			color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);
		}
		.register-section .join-us {
			font-size: 13px;
			margin-bottom: 10px;
		}
		.register-section .social-row {
			display: flex;
			justify-content: center;
			gap: 14px;
			margin-bottom: 26px;
		}
		.register-section .social-row .icon-slot {
			width: 30px;
			height: 30px;
			border-radius: 50%;
			background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
			display: flex;
			align-items: center;
			justify-content: center;
			font-size: 12px;
		}
		.register-section .footer-note {
			font-size: 11px;
			opacity: .7;
			padding-bottom: 20px;
		}

		@media(max-width:900px) {
			.speakers-section .speakers-grid {
				grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
			}
			.highlights-section .highlight-row {
				flex-direction: column;
			}
			.header-section .hero-content h1 {
				font-size: 32px;
			}
		}
		.intro-section .intro-title {
			text-transform: uppercase;
			font-size: 40px;
		}
		.intro-section .intro-text a {
			color: #18c392;
		}

		.highlights-section .highlights-title {
			text-align: left;
			text-transform: uppercase;
			font-size: 40px;
		}
		.highlights-section .tag {
			border: 1px solid var(--red);
			color: var(--red);
		}
		.register-section form {

			width: 50%;

			max-width: initial;
		}

		.intro-section .intro-title {
			text-transform: uppercase;
		}
		.intro-section .intro-text a {
			color: #18c392;
		}
		.highlights-section .highlights-title {
			text-align: left;
			text-transform: uppercase;
			font-size: 40px;
		}
		.highlights-section .tag {
			border: 1px solid var(--red);
			color: var(--red);
		}
		.register-section .register-title {
			text-transform: uppercase;
			font-size: 40px;
		}

		.register-section form [type="submit"] {
			width: 50%;
			margin: auto;
		}
		.speakers-section .speakers-title {
			text-transform: uppercase;
			font-size: 40px;
		}

		body .register-section form input {
			background: #ffffff42 !important;
			border: 1px solid #fff !important;
			color: #fff;
		}

		.register-section input::placeholder {
			color: #fff !important;
		}
		.highlights-section .highlight-row {
			max-width: initial;
		}
		.speaker-card .sp-tooltip {

			width: 500 PX;
		}
		.avatar-ring {
			position: relative;
			width: 180px;
			height: 180px;
			margin: auto;
			border-radius: 50%;
		}

		/* Decorative ring */
		.avatar-ring::before {
			content: "";
			position: absolute;
			inset: -20px;
			border-radius: 50%;

			background: repeating-conic-gradient(#20c4ff 0deg 8deg, transparent 8deg 18deg);

			/* thickness of the bars */
			-webkit-mask: radial-gradient(farthest-side, transparent calc(100% - 28px), #000 calc(100% - 28px));

			mask: radial-gradient(farthest-side, transparent calc(100% - 28px), #000 calc(100% - 28px));
		}

		/* Image */
		.avatar-slot {
			position: absolute;
			inset: 0;
			border-radius: 50%;
			overflow: hidden;

			z-index: 2;
		}

		.avatar-slot img {
			width: 100%;
			height: 100%;
			object-fit: cover;
		}

		.featured-speaker {
			display: flex;
			align-items: center;
			gap: 0 30px;
			margin-bottom: 5%;
		}

		.fs-badge {
			color: var(--red);
			font-size: 23px;
		}

		.featured-speaker .fs-badge {
			margin: 5px 0;
		}
		.fs-name {
			font-size: 23px;
		}
		.register-section {
			position: relative;
			padding: 80px 8% 40px;
			color: var(--white);
			text-align: center;

			background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(16, 35, 45, 0.55), rgba(16, 35, 45, 0.9)), url("/themes/custom/cfc/CFC/assets/images/footer_1.jpg");

			background-size: cover;
			background-position: center;
			background-repeat: no-repeat;
		}
		@media(max-width: 991px) {
			.featured-speaker {
				margin-bottom: 20px;
				gap: 20px 0;
			}
			.featured-speaker {
				margin-bottom: 0;
				flex-direction: column;
			}
			.img-slot {
				width: 100%;
			}
			.img-slot img {
				width: 100%;
			}
			.speakers-section .speakers-grid {
				flex-direction: column;
				display: flex;
			}
			.register-section form {
				width: 100%;
			}
			.register-section form [type="submit"] {
				width: 100%;
			}
		}


		.img-slot img {
			width: 100%;
		}

		.register-section form label {
			display: none !important;
		}
		body .register-section form .wrapper_submit input {
			display: inline-block;
			background: var(--teal-3) !important;
			color: var(--navy);
			font-weight: 700;
			font-size: 13px;
			letter-spacing: 1px;
			padding: 10px 26px;
			border: none;
			border-radius: 20px;
			cursor: pointer;
			text-transform: uppercase;
		}
		body .register-section form .wrapper_submit input svg {
			display: none;
		}
		body .register-section form .wrapper_submit svg {
			display: none;
		}
		body .speaker-card .sp-tooltip {
			width: 500 PX !important;
			bottom: auto;
		}
		.speaker-detail-panel {
			position: fixed;
			top: 0;
			right: 0;
			height: 100%;
			width: 420px;
			max-width: 90vw;
			background: var(--white);
			box-shadow: -12px 0 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35);
			z-index: 1000;
			overflow-y: auto;
			padding: 40px 32px;
			transform: translateX(100%);
			transition: transform 0.35s ease;
		}

		.speaker-detail-panel.active {
			transform: translateX(0);
		}

		.speaker-detail-overlay {
			position: fixed;
			inset: 0;
			background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
			z-index: 999;
			opacity: 0;
			visibility: hidden;
			transition: opacity 0.3s ease;
		}

		.speaker-detail-overlay.active {
			opacity: 1;
			visibility: visible;
		}

		.speaker-detail-close {
			position: absolute;
			top: 20px;
			right: 20px;
			background: none;
			border: none;
			font-size: 22px;
			cursor: pointer;
			color: var(--ink);
		}

		.speaker-detail-photo {
			width: 140px;
			height: 140px;
			border-radius: 50%;
			object-fit: cover;
			margin-bottom: 20px;
		}

		.speaker-detail-name {
			font-size: 20px;
			font-weight: 700;
			margin: 0 0 6px;
			color: var(--maroon, #7a1e2b);
		}

		.speaker-detail-role {
			font-size: 13px;
			text-transform: uppercase;
			font-weight: 600;
			color: var(--maroon, #7a1e2b);
			line-height: 1.5;
			margin-bottom: 20px;
		}

		.speaker-detail-bio {
			font-size: 14px;
			line-height: 1.7;
			color: var(--ink);
			white-space: pre-line;
		}

		.speaker-card {
			cursor: pointer;
		}

		body.panel-open {
			overflow: hidden;
		}

		.sp-tooltip {
			display: none;
		}
		bio-toggle {
			display: inline-block;
			margin-top: 8px;
			background: none;
			border: none;
			color: #1a9e8f; /* couleur à ajuster selon ton design */
			font-weight: bold;
			cursor: pointer;
			padding: 0;
		}
		.bio-toggle:hover {
			text-decoration: underline;
		}
		.bio-toggle {
			background: transparent;
			color: #3ec7c3;
			border: 0;
			padding-top: 12px;
			font-size: 18px;
		}
	</style>
</head>
<body>

	<!-- ============================================================ top: calc(100% + 12px); -->

	<!-- 1. HEADER SECTION — class="header-section"                   -->
	<!-- Replace .logo-slot img src with the real CFC logo.
															  HEADER SECTION — class="header-section"              -->
	<!-- Replace .support-logo-slot img src with the partner logo.     -->
	<!-- The fan-graphic svg is a placeholder for the radiating motif. -->
	<!-- ============================================================ -->
		<div class="header-section" id="header"> <div class="hero-content">
			<div class="edition-row-img">
				<img src="/themes/custom/cfc/CFC/assets/images/header__1.png" alt="partner logo placeholder">
			</div>
			{# <h1>CASABLANCA<br><span>BUSINESS</span> FORUM</h1>
																																																									    <div class="edition-row">
																																																									     <img src="/themes/custom/cfc/CFC/assets/images/diaport_1.jpeg" alt="partner logo placeholder">
																																																									    </div>
																																																									    <div class="hero-sub">Africa's Next Economic Chapter</div> #}


		</div>
	</div>
	<a href="/en/cbforum/#register" class="kk_kk">

		<button class="btn-register">Register now</button>
	</a>
	<!-- ============================================================ -->
	<!-- 2. INTRO SECTION — class="intro-section"                     -->
	<!-- ============================================================ -->
		<section class="intro-section" id="intro"> <h2 class="intro-title">Africa's Next<br>Economic Chapter</h2>
		<div class="intro-text">
			<p>In a world shaped by geopolitical shifts, technological disruption, climate challenges and evolving investment dynamics, Africa is entering a defining phase of its economic transformation. With its demographic momentum, abundant natural resources, expanding entrepreneurial ecosystems and growing regional integration, the continent has all the ingredients to become one of the world's next major growth engines. Unlocking this potential, however, requires stronger partnerships, greater investment and bold collective action.</p>
			<p>As Africa's leading financial centre, Casablanca Finance City has established itself as a strategic gateway connecting international capital with opportunities across the continent. Bringing together nearly 300 companies operating in more than 50 African countries, CFC plays a central role in supporting investment, regional integration and sustainable economic development.</p>
			<p>Building on the success of its inaugural edition, the
				<a href="#">
					Casablanca Business Forum
				</a>
				returns on
				<a href="#">2 October 2026</a>
				under the theme
				<a href="#">"Africa's Next Economic Chapter.</a>" The Forum will convene senior government officials, business leaders, investors, financial institutions and international experts to explore the opportunities shaping Africa's next phase of growth and identify the partnerships, policies and investment strategies needed to accelerate the continent's transformation.</p>
		</div>


